142: /**
143:  * Brackets end a markdown label early, and `Paper [draft].pdf` is an ordinary attachment
144:  * name. Stripping is the only option: Roam honours no escape, and `\[` was verified in a
145:  * graph to break exactly as a bare `[` does.
