153: /**
154:  * The label for an asset Roam renders as a link rather than as content. Without it the
155:  * visible text is the storage URL, so this is the only place a reader learns what an
156:  * imported file is called. A row that records no name has nothing better than the uid
157:  * leaf to fall back to.
158:  */
