DECISION CASES
{"id": "PUB-04", "title": "Uncheck a group that is already shared", "expected": "Not specified.", "why": "Unchecking does nothing and the node stays shared with G1. Neither app has an unshare path, so the checkbox suggests an action that does not exist.", "src": "ENG-1968 (open question)"}
